{"id":"h-0137","domain":"food truck menu board","names":["Tacos","Burgers","Fries","Drinks"],"text":"Hey I run a food truck and the menu board is a mess, so please move Drinks to the right of Fries. Make Tacos a large orange star because it sells the most. Which item has the most connections? And do I have any squares on the board right now?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Drinks","position":"rightOf","anchor":"Fries"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Tacos","size":"large"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Tacos","color":"orange"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Tacos","shape":"star"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"mostConnected"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"exists","shape":"square"}}]}
{"id":"h-0138","domain":"election map","names":["North2","South2","East","West"],"text":"For the election map, color North2 blue and South2 red. Put East between North2 and South2 so the split is clear. Which region is the rightmost? Finally, how many shapes are blue?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"North2","color":"blue"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"South2","color":"red"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"East","position":"between","anchor":"North2,South2"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"rightmost"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"count","color":"blue"}}]}
{"id":"h-0139","domain":"house wiring diagram","names":["Panel","Kitchen2","Garage","Outlet"],"text":"I'm wiring the house and the panel should be in the garage, so move Panel near Garage. Connect Panel to Kitchen2 with a plain line, no arrow, and label it 20A. Is Outlet connected to anything right now? Also make Garage a small gray square.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Panel","position":"near","anchor":"Garage"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Panel","to":"Kitchen2","arrow":"none","label":"20A"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"degree","target":"Outlet"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Garage","size":"small"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Garage","color":"gray"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Garage","shape":"square"}}]}
{"id":"h-0140","domain":"product roadmap","names":["Alpha","Beta","Ga","Launch3"],"text":"Let's mark the roadmap stages, so set Alpha to purple and Beta to purple too. Ga should be a huge star and placed above Launch3. What are the rules for new shapes right now? Also which shape is the rightmost?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Alpha","color":"purple"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Beta","color":"purple"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Ga","size":"huge"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Ga","shape":"star"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Ga","position":"above","anchor":"Launch3"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"rules"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"rightmost"}}]}
{"id":"h-0141","domain":"chemistry lab bench","names":["Beaker","Burner","Flask","Vent"],"text":"pls connect Beaker to Flask with a dotted line since they r linked in the experiment. move Burner below Beaker. Make the Vent red and tiny. What is the degree of Flask? Also how many shapes are red?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Beaker","to":"Flask","style":"dotted"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Burner","position":"below","anchor":"Beaker"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Vent","color":"red"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Vent","size":"tiny"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"degree","target":"Flask"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"count","color":"red"}}]}
{"id":"h-0142","domain":"zombie survival map","names":["Base2","Farm","Ruins2","Road2"],"text":"okay for the zombie game i want Base2 huge and blue. put Farm to the left of Ruins2. Which is the nearest shape to Road2, is it Farm or Ruins2? Also connect Base2 to Road2 with a dashed arrow.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Base2","size":"huge"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Base2","color":"blue"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Farm","position":"leftOf","anchor":"Ruins2"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"nearest","anchor":"Road2","superlative":"closest"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Base2","to":"Road2","style":"dashed"}}]}
{"id":"h-0143","domain":"charity event timeline","names":["Setup2","Event","Cleanup","Thanks"],"text":"Our charity event needs a timeline, so connect Setup2 to Event with a plain arrow, then Event to Cleanup with another plain arrow. Make Thanks a small teal circle and put it below Cleanup. Which shape is the bottommost right now? Please and thank you!","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Setup2,Event,Cleanup","pairing":"chain"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Thanks","size":"small"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Thanks","color":"teal"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Thanks","shape":"circle"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Thanks","position":"below","anchor":"Cleanup"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"bottommost"}}]}
{"id":"h-0144","domain":"stock trading flow","names":["Signal","Buy","Sell","Hold"],"text":"The trading bot flow needs an extra check, so insert a diamond called Risk between Signal and Buy. Color Risk red and connect Risk to Hold with a dotted arrow labeled skip. Is Sell reachable from Signal? How many arrows leave Risk?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"create","shape":"diamond","name":"Risk","position":"between","anchor":"Signal,Buy"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"$new","color":"red"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"$new","to":"Hold","style":"dotted","label":"skip"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"path","from":"Signal","to":"Sell"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"degree","target":"$new"}}]}
{"id":"h-0145","domain":"hotel lobby plan","names":["Lobby2","Desk","Keys","Elevator"],"text":"Please move Keys to the right of Desk, because guests reach for them there. Make Elevator a large gray rectangle and put it above Lobby2. Who is directly linked to Desk? Also what is the most connected shape in the lobby?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Keys","position":"rightOf","anchor":"Desk"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Elevator","size":"large"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Elevator","color":"gray"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Elevator","shape":"rectangle"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Elevator","position":"above","anchor":"Lobby2"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"neighbors","target":"Desk"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"mostConnected"}}]}
{"id":"h-0146","domain":"calculus concept map","names":["Limit","Derivative","Integral","Series"],"text":"For my calculus notes, connect Limit to Derivative with a solid arrow and then Derivative to Integral with a dashed one. Move Series to the bottom of the page. Is Integral directly connected to Limit? I think it is not.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Limit","to":"Derivative"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Derivative","to":"Integral","style":"dashed"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Series","position":"bottom"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"connected","target":"Integral","anchor":"Limit"}}]}
{"id":"h-0147","domain":"aquarium setup","names":["Tank1","Tank2","Filter4","Heater"],"text":"Hey, I'm setting up the aquarium diagram. Please put Heater between Tank1 and Tank2, and make the Filter4 a small cyan square. Which shape is the largest right now? Also remove the arrow from Tank1 to Tank2, it is not needed.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Heater","position":"between","anchor":"Tank1,Tank2"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Filter4","size":"small"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Filter4","color":"cyan"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Filter4","shape":"square"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"biggest"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"disconnect","from":"Tank1","to":"Tank2"}}]}
{"id":"h-0148","domain":"gym circuit plan","names":["Squat","Pushup","Plank","Rest"],"text":"For my gym circuit I want the exercises in a row, so arrange Squat, Pushup, Plank and Rest in a row. Connect Squat to Pushup with a plain arrow, and label it 30s. Make Rest a large blue oval. Which exercise is the rightmost one?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"arrange","target":"Squat,Pushup,Plank,Rest","layout":"row"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Squat","to":"Pushup","label":"30s"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Rest","size":"large"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Rest","color":"blue"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Rest","shape":"ellipse"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"rightmost"}}]}
{"id":"h-0149","domain":"ocean poster for fourth grade","names":["Coral","Shark","Fish","Plankton"],"text":"Our ocean poster needs fixing. Move Shark above Fish, and make Plankton a tiny green circle. Is Coral bigger than Shark? Also connect Plankton to Fish with a dotted arrow, since the little fish eat them.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Shark","position":"above","anchor":"Fish"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Plankton","size":"tiny"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Plankton","color":"green"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Plankton","shape":"circle"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"check","target":"Coral","comparison":"bigger","anchor":"Shark"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Plankton","to":"Fish","style":"dotted"}}]}
